WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.245
P6.2 · Value over time: what moved it

2
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:10.377
After each closing, Update from the books reads the ledger and the forecast again.

3
00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:16.785
Recompute values the case, and the value is recorded: the Value over time card draws the line.

4
00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:24.571
Between two points, K-phi swaps one group of inputs at a time and values the case after each swap.

5
00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:30.089
The steps add up to the change: what management created, apart from what the market did.

6
00:00:31.935 --> 00:00:36.939
Rates went up; operations still added value. That is what a board remembers.

7
00:00:39.935 --> 00:00:45.296
Lock signs a value off: a locked case never changes, and the Home tile shows it.

8
00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:47.909
Duplicate it to keep working next month.

9
00:00:49.359 --> 00:00:52.893
Next: P6.3  Football field and the report

